        <mxCell id="vIv0GGofDIMRJwX6vlFP-6" value="Key Considerations:&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mood Buttons don&#39;t actually work✅&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Theme needs to be saved✅&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;There is a database --&amp;gt; need to configure how it works upon loading cloud data✅&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Need to have two HTML pages - Login, Index✅&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Can only access index after logging in✅&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Login page needs to have all product information&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No local storage note saving, cloud only✅&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Need to consider using React framework&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Settings and help need to be configured --&amp;gt; separate pages&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Repeating tasks need to be configured&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Need to create notifications&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;Current errors that need fixing:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Landing page needs to be completed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Day Planner section changing calendar buttons need fixing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Daily Habits doesn&#39;t reset daily or show historical records - consider if it just sets up your plan instead of tracks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spending Metrics graph does not work&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AI planner task tracker is not in div box&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AI planner is not configured yet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9933FF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
